    "text": "<math><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>∆</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>241.6</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>228.4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />For 1 mole of&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>=-</mo><mn>44</mn><mtext>&nbsp;J</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mtext>K</mtext> <mrow> <mtext>-1</mtext></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Hence, for 2 moles <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>88</mn><mtext>&nbsp;J</mtext><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mtext>K</mtext> <mrow> <mtext>-1</mtext></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math>"
